/E (The Ability People is a dedicated non-profit organisation committed to empowering individuals with disabilities, particularly from underprivileged and tribal communities. Our mission is to build an inclusive, accessible society through a holistic approach that combines medical rehabilitation, social empowerment, and community-based solutions.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [2]
