/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 90 0 R
/E (We specialise in delivering comprehensive rehabilitation services, including physiotherapy, prosthetics and orthotics, assistive device distribution, and early intervention support for children with disabilities. A major focus of our work includes Spinal Cord Injury \(SCI\) rehabilitation, where we provide long-term care plans, assistive aids, and family counselling to help patients regain mobility and dignity.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [3]
>>
