/E (We operate through a strong network of referral and sub-centres at GGH Paderu and King George Hospital Visakhapatnam ensuring rehabilitation services reach even the most remote regions. Through partnerships with government institutions, medical colleges, NGOs, and local communities, we are building sustainable and scalable models of care.)
