256 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 96 0 R
/E (On April 11, 2024, The Ability People organised a Spinal Cord Injury and Road Safety Awareness Program at RK Beach, Visakhapatnam, as part of our efforts to prevent disability through community education. The event was graced by the Joint Collector Sri. K. Venkateswar Rao IAS as the Chief Guest, and Smt. Madhavi Jallepalli, Disability Welfare Officer, as the Special Guest.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
257 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 96 0 R
/E (The program brought together a large network of stakeholders, including special schools, NGOs, caregivers, and rehabilitation professionals working in the disability sector. Through placards, public addresses, and interactive sessions, the event created strong awareness about road safety, spinal cord injury prevention, and the importance of inclusive practices for people with disabilities.)
