/E (As part of our ongoing outreach, The Ability People conducted an Assessment Program in Paderu under the guidance of the District Collector, with the aim of identifying children and adults in need of rehabilitation services. The camp was attended by approximately 50 beneficiaries, including individuals with various physical and neurological conditions. The program focused on early identification, referral, and planning for assistive devices and therapy, ensuring access to rehabilitation services in this remote tribal region.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
280 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
