/P 98 0 R
/E (The Ability People conducted an Assessment Program at Makkavaripalem near Narsipatnam, reaching approximately 50 individuals with disabilities. The program was organised with the valuable support of a local NGO, focusing on identifying needs for assistive devices, physiotherapy, and referral services to strengthen community-based rehabilitation efforts in the region.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
